Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.79,0:01:25.04,EP1 Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1200,1300)\pos(551.6,649.2)}Meow!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.32,0:01:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I name you...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.22,0:01:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.25,0:01:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You already decided?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.96,0:01:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm "little white", he's "little black".
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.90,0:01:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Cute, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.96,0:01:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's rather random...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.36,0:01:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So you named me also rather randomly?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.96,0:01:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,On a second thought...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.38,0:01:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Luo Xiaohei is an amazing name!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.96,0:01:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,He's awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.63,0:01:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.47,0:01:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You scared him!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.43,0:01:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.63,0:01:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.94,0:01:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.67,0:02:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.54,0:02:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom! What happened to the plate?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.38,0:02:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, it wasn't me...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.41,0:02:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Xiaohei must have pulled it behind there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.25,0:02:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,That's odd, should we check on him?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.07,0:02:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope nothing's wrong...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.01,0:02:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He's coming out!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.33,0:02:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.10,0:02:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder why he's so obedient now...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.38,0:02:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You did scare him back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.87,0:02:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got a blue tongue.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.13,0:02:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Do cats have blue tongues?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.02,0:02:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,How should I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.45,0:02:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,All done!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.10,0:02:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow I'll have to buy cat litter and tray.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.14,0:02:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What are those for?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.18,0:02:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That'll be the cat's toilet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.96,0:02:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't he use ours?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.63,0:02:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Show me a cat that would sit on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.92,0:02:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.92,0:03:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you're not just an ordinary cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.05,0:03:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd you come from, after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.12,0:03:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.14,0:03:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Your owner must have loved you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.46,0:03:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,They must have had no choice but to leave you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.14,0:03:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,From now on, I'll be your owner.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.62,0:03:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Luo Xiaobai.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.97,0:03:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you, Xiaohei!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.25,0:03:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiao...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.32,0:03:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.34,0:03:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I am...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.41,0:03:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,A prince who has been cursed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.87,0:03:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for lifting the curse off me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.83,0:03:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,By kissing you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.92,0:03:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.03,0:03:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So cliché...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.36,0:03:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you like to come to my castle tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.70,0:03:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I must properly thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.18,0:03:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.12,0:03:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to go to school tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.65,0:03:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us meet at the weekend, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.91,0:03:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.01,0:03:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Diting! The Sky Pearl was stolen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.70,0:04:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you admit your failure?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.07,0:04:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, master.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.34,0:04:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I will recover the Sky Pearl.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.14,0:04:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Easier said than done,\Nfor vast is the sea of beings.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.15,0:04:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I wounded the culprit and made him revert to his original form.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.01,0:04:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,He should still be nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.45,0:04:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well. Do not return without the Pearl.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.26,0:04:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.89,0:05:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.97,0:05:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.71,0:05:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Good kitty! Come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.46,0:05:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna be late! Come quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.36,0:06:01.19,EP2 Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1200,0)\pos(394.8,666.8)}Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.14,0:05:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.92,0:06:10.50,Dad,,0,0,0,,{\pos(725,564)\frz40}I
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.92,0:06:10.50,Dad,,0,0,0,,{\pos(803,550)\frz5\frx-20\fry-40}Am
