Dialogue: -1000,0:06:03.92,0:06:10.50,SE-box-bg9904,,0,0,0,,{\p1}m 714 450 l 770 421 783 500 736 505{\p0}
Dialogue: -1000,0:06:03.92,0:06:10.50,SE-box-bg9904,,0,0,0,,{\p1}m790 338 l 840 350 845 420 790 415{\p0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.19,0:06:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom, Xiaohei started to eat your breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.86,0:06:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like he won't eat cat food.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.67,0:06:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucky my first thing today was to buy some.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.34,0:06:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,This way we can share our food with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.89,0:06:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't you be going?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.35,0:06:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no! I gotta get to school!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.29,0:06:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for me, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.60,0:06:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.64,0:07:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,A cat?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.83,0:08:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.84,0:08:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.78,0:08:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei tried to run away?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.15,0:08:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he somehow opened the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.36,0:08:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I caught him and brought him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.69,0:08:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You should decide if we let him go or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.72,0:08:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.82,0:09:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.58,0:09:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.84,0:09:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.03,0:09:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.34,0:09:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.45,0:09:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.68,0:09:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, this place is full of cars and dogs...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.80,0:09:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,If you really want to leave,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.29,0:09:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take you out of town this weekend.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.31,0:09:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.92,0:09:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaobai!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.79,0:09:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing up there? Come down!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.49,0:09:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.35,0:10:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.84,0:10:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello? Hi, Shan Xin!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.26,0:10:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.51,0:10:41.35,EP3 Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1200,0)\pos(1453.2,656.8)}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.31,0:10:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You wanna see Xiaohei?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.09,0:10:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, when can you come over?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.29,0:10:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,At the door?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.20,0:10:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,'Sup.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.22,0:10:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.22,0:10:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Long time no see, Xiaohuang!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.05,0:10:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,This is for Xiaohei.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.35,0:10:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.10,0:10:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he'll love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.85,0:10:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Shan Xin.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.37,0:10:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Mrs. Luo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.32,0:10:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be cleaning here, you can go have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.30,0:10:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.54,0:10:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot your mom always looks like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.60,0:11:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.65,0:11:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Go say hello to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.04,0:11:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Huang?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.17,0:11:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems like he's scared of Xiaohei.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.10,0:11:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Cats tend to be quite timid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.82,0:11:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.69,0:11:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch and learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.54,0:11:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.39,0:11:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Catch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.39,0:11:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He caught it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.42,0:11:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,One more time!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.87,0:11:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei, you're awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.15,0:11:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.34,0:11:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The point is to do your best not to catch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.32,0:11:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.47,0:11:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Come!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.64,0:11:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he making fun of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.23,0:12:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Girls! I'm leaving for work!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.32,0:12:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.22,0:12:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course you found an excuse again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.33,0:12:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I did bring Xiaohuang to meet Xiaohei.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.39,0:12:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,So I end up having to take care of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.69,0:12:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.39,0:12:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Whose side are you on this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.47,0:12:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The Horde!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.62,0:12:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally up, lazy cat?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.04,0:12:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei, what happened to your tail?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.89,0:12:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What are those?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.47,0:12:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Your tail!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.34,0:12:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,So a cat's tail can turn into tiny kitties!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.29,0:12:56.34,Animal,,0,0,0,,Hei-xiu!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.34,0:12:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,"Heixiu"?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.34,0:12:58.19,Animal,,0,0,0,,Hei-xiu!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.87,0:12:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I see, your name's Heixiu!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.55,0:13:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohuang!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.72,0:13:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohuang!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.42,0:13:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Come down, Xiaohuang!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.17,0:13:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Be a good kitty!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.17,0:13:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Come down!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.83,0:13:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohuang!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.23,0:13:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.93,0:13:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, bring him back!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.60,0:14:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.76,0:14:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.15,0:14:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm at Xiaobai's.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.54,0:14:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Come over?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.19,0:14:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing. I'll see you soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.35,0:14:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Huzzah, fair maiden!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.78,0:14:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want a silver scale breastplate?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.91,0:14:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Silver scale breastplate!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.18,0:14:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,First class product!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.37,0:14:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Only 5 gold-
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.64,0:14:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.59,0:14:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,No idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.64,0:14:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohuang...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.79,0:14:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,He's in heat...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.68,0:15:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You two can't procreate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.83,0:15:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,From this day on,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.29,0:15:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be your faithful servant.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.33,0:16:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You only have to sign this contract, my dear!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.58,0:15:58.62,Insurance,,0,0,0,,{\pos(427,1020)}Insurance
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.62,0:15:58.66,Insurance,,0,0,0,,{\pos(427,970)}Insurance
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.66,0:15:58.70,Insurance,,0,0,0,,{\pos(427,940)}Insurance
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.70,0:15:58.74,Insurance,,0,0,0,,{\pos(427,915)}Insurance
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.74,0:15:58.79,Insurance,,0,0,0,,{\pos(427,890)}Insurance
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.79,0:15:58.83,Insurance,,0,0,0,,{\pos(427,873)}Insurance
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.83,0:15:58.87,Insurance,,0,0,0,,{\pos(427,860)}Insurance
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.87,0:15:58.92,Insurance,,0,0,0,,{\pos(427,845)}Insurance
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.92,0:15:58.96,Insurance,,0,0,0,,{\pos(427,837)}Insurance
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.00,0:15:59.04,Insurance,,0,0,0,,{\pos(427,837)}Insurance
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.02,0:16:00.71,Insurance,,0,0,0,,{\pos(427,837)}Insurance
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.09,0:16:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Who was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.13,0:16:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,A minor character.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.73,0:16:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you finish packing? Don't forget anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.84,0:16:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.77,0:16:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you called them?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.80,0:16:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.44,0:16:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Who answered?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.57,0:16:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Cousin Gen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.56,0:16:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Your school stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.43,0:16:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,All done!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.23,0:16:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Got enough socks?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.97,0:16:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll wear sandals.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.07,0:16:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Your toothbrush?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.95,0:16:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.09,0:16:30.49,EP4 Title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(1200,0)\pos(1369.8,713.6)}Fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.53,0:18:13.40,Animal,,0,0,0,,Mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.96,0:18:18.41,Animal,,0,0,0,,Come quick, they're gonna fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.64,0:18:39.04,Animal,,0,0,0,,Don't cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.94,0:18:41.97,Animal,,0,0,0,,You can play with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.94,0:19:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.84,0:19:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.75,0:19:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.19,0:19:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe he's on the roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.76,0:19:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right! I'll check!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.00,0:19:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But no climbing up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.74,0:19:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.02,0:19:28.70,Animal,,0,0,0,,Heixiu?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.39,0:19:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't find him anywhere...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.67,0:19:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, he must be playing hide-and-seek.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.11,0:19:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But what if we won't see him anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.83,0:19:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.15,0:19:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.82,0:19:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.00,0:19:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Where've you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.37,0:19:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Isn't that my dress?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.65,0:19:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you make it so dirty?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.73,0:19:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Bad kitty!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.57,0:20:05.71,Guest,,0,0,0,,{\pos(370,370)\fs300}Birdie
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.57,0:20:05.71,Guest,,0,0,0,,{\pos(255,370)\fs70}Special Guest
Dialogue: -1000,0:20:02.57,0:20:05.71,SE-box-bg5566,,0,0,0,,{\p1}m 0 0 l 950 0 950 500 0 500{\p0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.69,0:20:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Found you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.33,0:20:32.71,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Stay with me - let's walk on, kicking pebbles as we go
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.33,0:20:32.71,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Stay with me aruite yukou ishikoro wo kette
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.71,0:20:37.45,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Our destination may be whimsical
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.71,0:20:37.45,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Yukisaki wa kitto kimagure demo
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.45,0:20:42.15,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,But with the scent of flowers in both hands
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.45,0:20:42.15,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Hana no kaori wo ryoute ni
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.15,0:20:48.35,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,I’ll carry it to the you I’ve yet to meet
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.15,0:20:48.35,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,kore kara deau kimi e to
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.35,0:20:54.50,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Wait for me — let’s talk, side by side
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.35,0:20:54.50,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Wait for me hanashi wo shiyou kata wo narabete
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.50,0:20:59.30,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Even if our first “hello” is a little awkward
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.50,0:20:59.30,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Hajimemashite wa gikochinaku temo
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.30,0:21:03.98,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,When we open the boxes we’ve brought
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.30,0:21:03.98,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Mochiyotta hako aketara
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.98,0:21:10.50,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Let’s share the dreams we’ve packed inside
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.98,0:21:10.50,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Tsumekon da yume wo wakeaou
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.50,0:21:21.82,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,The days when we can casually say “See you tomorrow”
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.50,0:21:21.82,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Mata ashita tte atarimae ni kawaseru hibi ga
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.82,0:21:27.24,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Are so precious and so fleeting
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.82,0:21:27.24,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Itoshikute hakanasugite
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.24,0:21:32.28,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Those feelings will never fade away
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.24,0:21:32.28,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Omoi wa kitto kienai
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.28,0:21:43.51,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,We can’t catch up to the clouds drifting across the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.28,0:21:43.51,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Sora wo nagareru kumo ni wa oitsukenai kedo
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.51,0:21:49.06,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,But they’ll turn to rain, bloom into flowers
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.51,0:21:49.06,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Ame ni natte hana wo tsukete
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.06,0:21:55.90,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,And surely, they’re calling out to me
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.06,0:21:55.90,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Kitto boku wo yonderu
